{"version":1,"content":"<p>市場研究機構Counterpoint Research最新預測顯示，隨着蘋果預計將為MacBook Pro產品線導入OLED顯示技術，Mini-LED筆記本顯示面板市場正面臨快速萎縮。數據顯示，2025年至2027年期間，Mini-LED筆記本面板年度出貨量預計將累計下滑約75%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583924.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:40:56.126574+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:08.821502+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:08.821502+00:00","content_hash":"b14d41bb1f2cb827e881b0807df7acd6d8388bdc8197b0c2e0786d6fa50c40d9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}